Subject: [PATCH] cli: show extender uplink bars and readable cohort labels

Display a segmented signal meter beside each wireless extender using its
actual upstream link metric. Preserve fresh, stale and unknown status and
refresh the meter in place without changing node positions.

Enlarge client identities without changing band/channel text. Show the IoT
and private cohorts as two-line iot_/ssid and sta_/ssid titles in a reserved
sector inside each bubble, clear of the default station RF paths. Keep real
SSID values and manually dragged client positions unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [HWSIM evaluation WebUI]

diff --git a/src/rdkb-cli/static/script.js b/src/rdkb-cli/static/script.js
